  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a warm welcome to any classroom or learning space. Designed with a classic composition notebook style, it combines functionality with a unique touch. Its durable construction makes it an ideal addition for both indoor and outdoor settings, effectively capturing dirt and moisture to keep floors clean.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalizable with a teacher's name for a unique touch</li>\n<li>Soft, heat-resistant non-woven fabric top</li>\n<li>Non-slip neoprene rubber backing for stability</li>\n<li>Effectively traps dirt, dust, and grime</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Personalization</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy, Neoprene Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft non-woven fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Avoid bleaching</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drying</td>\n<td>Air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is suitable for classrooms, entryways, and RVs, making it a versatile option for various settings. It creates a welcoming atmosphere at classroom doors, reading corners, or teacher spaces.</p>",
